  "title": "Indian Tomato Chicken",
  "description": "Ginger, garlic, cumin, cinnamon, turmeric and a host of exotic spices coat sauteed chicken in tomato sauce. A long simmer seals in the complex flavors of this aromatic dish.",
  "authors": [
